# Setup Awal Portfolio Fullstack

## 1. Clone Repository
```bash
git clone https://github.com/wanglin-khas/portfolio-fullstack.git
cd portfolio-fullstack
```

## 2. Buat Struktur Folder
```bash
mkdir -p frontend/app backend/src backend/prisma docs .github/workflows
```

## 3. Inisialisasi Project
```bash
# Frontend setup
cd frontend
npm init -y
npm install

# Backend setup
cd ../backend
npm init -y
npm install prisma
npx prisma init
```

## 4. Konfigurasi Environment
```bash
# Copy .env.example ke .env
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env dengan konfigurasi Anda
```

## 5. Push ke Repository
```bash
git add .
git commit -m "Initial commit: Full Stack Developer Portfolio"
git push origin main
```

## 6. Struktur Project
```
portfolio-fullstack/
├── frontend/
│   └── app/
├── backend/
│   ├── src/
│   ├── prisma/
│   └── package.json
├── docs/
├── .github/
│   └── workflows/
└── README.md
```
